<title>ITALY: Italy's Sept stock futures contract hits new high.</title>
<headline>Italy's Sept stock futures contract hits new high.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Fib30 September stock market futures contract rose to a fresh record high at 20,895 in early trade.</p>
<p>By 0750 GMT the contract was 304 basis points up at 20,850, above Tuesday's high of 20,840.</p>
<p>Brokers said they expected the contract to meet strong resistance at the psychological resistance level of 21,000.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
